  "modifications": [
    "Generated adult male body using MakeHuman macro parameters and the 53-bone GameEngine rig.",
    "Clothed workwear, shoes, short hair, eyebrows and low-poly eyes; covered hidden body faces removed.",
    "Baked two live material atlases: 2048-square basecolor/normal/ORM, 1024-square masked hair/brows; no root motion or collision metadata.",
    "Original in-place idle, walk, run, and visible pulse gesture authored at 30fps; paired full rigs for live and LOD.",
    "Authored six rigid anatomical regions from the posed clothed surface, sealed boundaries, reduced geometry, and original 512-square textured cut caps.",
    "Normalized visual height to 1.8m, Y-up glTF, local forward +Z. Gameplay geometry is unchanged.",
    "Authored 25 shared equipment meshes for all 12 families across tactical, rivals and arcade casts; one shared original 1024-square basecolor/normal/ORM gear atlas.",
    "Derived fitted vest and coat panels from the selected CC0 workwear. Baked original body shape keys before sampling arm/workwear cross-sections for tapered sleeves with rounded shoulder caps and overlapping elbow hems.",
    "Authored forward curved cap bills and fitted helmet/beanie shells against the baked body proportions. Authored pouches, straps, backpacks, hood, scarf, radio gear, guards, shield and bounded brace panels.",
    "Equipment is rigid, bone attached and cosmetic; existing paired rigs, four original clips, anatomical regions and caps are retained. Gameplay hitboxes and rules are unchanged.",
    "Settled equipment nodes reuse original mesh data with the authored idle-frame-zero damage pose; live bone bindings are unchanged. Matrices independently checked against the actual browser loader within 1.1e-7."
  ],
